<BaseLayout lastUpdated="2026-07-30">
  <SEOHead slot="head" title="Free Tattoo Waiver Generator | InkFlow" description="Generate free tattoo waiver forms for your studio. Customizable templates, PDF download, print-ready. No signup required." />
  <PageSchema type="article" data={ARTICLE} />
  <FAQSchema questions={[
    { question: "Is the waiver generator really free?", answer: "Yes. Generate unlimited waiver forms for free. No account or signup required." },
    { question: "What should a tattoo waiver form include?", answer: "A proper form combines informed consent (the client understands the procedure is permanent and the risks), a liability release, a health-screening block (medications, allergies, skin conditions, pregnancy), and an aftercare acknowledgment — then a dated signature." },
    { question: "Can clients sign the waiver on their phone?", answer: "With the free generator you print or share a PDF for a handwritten signature. InkFlow's digital waiver app lets clients sign on their phone via QR code at check-in, with timestamps and an audit trail stored in the cloud." },
    { question: "Is a digital waiver legally valid?", answer: "A properly executed electronic signature carries the same weight as a handwritten one under US e-signature law, provided the client consented to sign electronically and the record is retained. Requirements vary by state, so have your final form reviewed by an attorney." },
