      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">A printable form covers you on paper, but paper is fragile: industry figures put the loss rate near 60% within a year, and a lost form is a lost legal record. A <strong class="text-white">waiver app</strong> stores every signed form in the cloud with a timestamp and IP/audit trail, so you can pull any client's waiver in seconds — at inspection or if a dispute arises.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">The free generator gives you that printable starting point. When you're ready, a digital waiver tool lets clients sign on their phone via QR code at check-in, auto-fills their details from the booking, and never mis-files. The form content is the same — consent, liability release, health screening, aftercare acknowledgment, signature — but the delivery is what protects you long-term.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

